      - "Verify bit 12 to 15 is 0100 (version 4)"
      - "Verify bit 6 to 7 of clock sequence is 10 (RFC 4122 variant)"
      - "Format as 8-4-4-4-12 hex characters"
    result: "c3b8f1a2-9d4e-4b6a-8f12-5e3a7c8b9d0e"
  - title: "Microsoft COM / C# GUID Format"
